    "norm": "Verifies {@link ZstdUtils#matches(byte[], int)} for Zstandard \"skippable frame\" signatures. <p> A skippable frame is identified by a 4-byte magic number where: </p> <ul> <li>the first byte has its high nibble equal to {@code 0x5} (i.e. any value in the range {@code 0x50}-{@code 0x5F}), and</li> <li>the remaining three bytes are exactly {@code 0x2A 0x4D 0x18}.</li> </ul>"
